# The five hand-authored pages live in pages/. Every builder reads them from
# the repo root, injects into them and writes them back, so the root copies are
# build output -- scripts/stage_pages.mjs restores them from pages/ before each
# build. Tracking them made the source and the artifact the same file, which is
# how a hand edit could be silently overwritten and how an injection that
# stopped stripping accumulated 25 copies of one script into production.
# Edit pages/, never these.
/nueva-living-home.html
/developments.html
/compare.html
/thank-you.html
/404.html
